# The keyword strop makes the projection many-to-one even where the case survives: `break` becomes
# `break_` in C, C++ and Rust, which is a name the second field already spells. Both are conformant
# DSDL -- section 3.2.5 reserves only `_name_` -- so the scope has to keep them apart.
uint8 break
# The padding keeps this type from being a byte image in memory. A byte image's body moves the
# payload whole and names no member; this one reads each member by name, which is what the body
# check anchors on.
void8
uint8 break_
@sealed
